{
  "_doc": [
    "Seed Trackees. Each user references a presence schedule by `presence`.",
    "Presence schedule shapes:",
    "  - { \"kind\": \"none\" } — no presence tracking (admins default).",
    "  - { \"kind\": \"full_time\" } — always home.",
    "  - { \"kind\": \"n_week_grid\", \"nWeeks\": 2, \"epochDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\", \"cells\": [[...7 cells...], [...7 cells...]] }",
    "    Each cell is { \"kind\": \"home\" | \"away\", \"handoff_time\"?: \"HH:MM\" }.",
    "    Weekday order in each week row: Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri, Sat, Sun (ISO Mon-first).",
    "`devices` is optional; entries get created as a Device row under the Trackee."
